# Definition of Done

A user story is considered complete when:

- [ ] All acceptance criteria are satisfied.
- [ ] The implementation matches the requirements.
- [ ] Relevant unit tests have been written and pass.
- [ ] Relevant error cases have been tested.
- [ ] Code has been reviewed by another team member.
- [ ] The implementation has been merged into the main branch.
- [ ] The GitHub Actions CI pipeline passes.
- [ ] The linter reports no outstanding issues.
- [ ] Relevant documentation has been updated.
- [ ] The Product Owner has accepted the completed story.
